          "role": "user",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"c86ef99ca4b1bb72adc61e93632086d70eebb45d6c20e9ebbcdfe1a7ce81c20f\" kind=\"text\" label=\"delivery evidence\">\nFrom: Dera Sovan <dera@example.test>\nTo: Rian Vem <rian@example.test>\nSubject: Translation handover\n\nHello Rian,\n\nAttached is handbook-english.docx, an editable DOCX containing the English translation of all six pages of your Hindi handbook. I have checked the page sequence against the source you supplied.\n\nThe bilingual terminology glossary was not prepared and is not included in this delivery. I have also attached certificate.pdf for your records; please review it separately.\n\nThe DOCX can be opened and edited in a word processor. Please let me know if you have trouble opening either attachment.\n\nRegards,\nDera\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
        }
